Read AGENT_FAST_PATH.md, relevant HARNESS.md feature/first-diff/lane-close rules, PRODUCT_DECISIONS.md, .agents/skills/implementing-features/SKILL.md, .orbit/loop.md, bin/orbit-agent-session-capture, apps/gateway/tests/Feature/E2ESupport/AgentSessionArchiveTest.php, harness-signals/README.md, the canonical lane-close signal, and minimal index-generator context. Apply TDD, Pest, Spatie PHP, and repo rules. Use apply_patch. Never run E2E.

