- apps/gateway/tests/Feature/E2ESupport/AgentSessionArchiveTest.php
- bin/orbit-agent-session-capture
- harness-signals/2026-07-07-lane-close-agent-session-capture.md
- harness-signals/index.json only via its canonical generator
- .agents/skills/implementing-features/SKILL.md for one narrow clause
Do not edit .orbit, commit, merge, archive, run full quality-check, or clean up.

First diff must be test-only. Add minimal focused fixtures proving:
1 malformed --incarnation-started-at is usage error before staging/capture;
2 floor + unique candidate with all valid canonical activity before floor -> loud stale_pre_restart_session;
3 floor + unique candidate with activity at/after -> ok and manifest records attested floor, source, rollout id, observed last_activity_at;
4 no flag keeps existing legacy/resume output and manifest behavior;
5 floor + duplicate owned candidates remains ambiguous even when only one is fresh;
6 session_meta top-level plus nested/payload timestamps never count; malformed/no parseable non-session_meta activity under a floor is stale.
Run the narrow new-test filter and retain literal expected RED output (not syntax/setup failure). Immediately continue after red.

Implement the smallest change:
- validate caller-attested --incarnation-started-at=<ISO8601> before DB lookup/staging;
- pass it only to Codex;
- existing marker discovery/cwd/primary-identity/cardinality stays intact; floor validates only after exactly one survivor and never eliminates/ranks;
- last_activity_at = maximum parseable canonical top-level timestamp across non-session_meta JSONL rows only;
- at/after passes; before/null/no-parseable -> stale_pre_restart_session;
- success/stale diagnostics/manifests record floor, source, rollout id, observed last_activity_at;
- without flag, behavior/output/manifest stays unchanged.
Update the canonical signal/evidence and regenerate index canonically. Add exactly one implementing-features clause: deliberate restart records restart time and passes the flag at lane close; failure requires explicit waiver; prefer fresh process IDs. No HARNESS/LOOP duplication.

Verify new-test filter, full AgentSessionArchiveTest.php, php -l helper, Mago format check on the Pest file, canonical signal/index validation, and minimal discoverability. Fix owned regressions only.

Final handoff: identity proof; first-test diff/stat; exact red command and literal failures; final diff; verification commands/counts/results; PRODUCT_DECISIONS impact; friction/guardrails; blockers. Then idle. Do not ask user questions; report precise ambiguity for orchestrator/Claude 943.

